  "notes": {
    "manas-2010:p1527:b001:l003": "бейпай misery/trouble, Yudakhin/1969 https://el-sozduk.kg/бейпай/; not бейпайда useless.",
    "manas-2010:p1527:b001:l007": "аса байла provisionally fasten/hang high, attached to bronze idol; not blindly substituted horse head tied high. Exact ritual arrangement unverified.",
    "manas-2010:p1527:b001:l013": "Калча Kongurbay’s grim-faced epithet, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/калча/ I1–2; repeated throughout, not mountain-Tajik ethnicity.",
    "manas-2010:p1527:b001:l018": "чоң great one/force, qualified ellipsis of army from surrounding lines; no named commander invented.",
    "manas-2010:p1527:b001:l023": "бут idol, distinct from foot homonym, in Almambet’s renunciation of former worship and flight to Burut; талак кыл renounce.",
    "manas-2010:p1528:b001:l007": "Printed Чын-Бээжин retained as Chin-Beijing, not harmonized to Чоң Great Beijing.",
    "manas-2010:p1528:b001:l008": "Threat to make children shriek retained, followed by tearing Chinese apart; no attempt to sanitize or turn proposed violence into enacted history.",
    "manas-2010:p1528:b001:l023": "биттеп-куштап lice/vermin infestation, clothing changes; no literal birds. Repeated separate garments for battle, dirt, dust and khan in peace all retained.",
    "manas-2010:p1528:b001:l029": "Named camel Желмаян retained as Zhelmayaan beside black pack-camel description, not replaced by a horse.",
    "manas-2010:p1528:b001:l032": "кош бадана торгой көз double mail with lark-eye meshes, exact edition glossary1839:26 onward explains manufacture/appearance; not new names for three separate suits.",
    "manas-2010:p1528:b001:l034": "Printed калаанын whole city retained as searched in materials/armor context. Relation to following соот тонго салдырган is compressed; no silent калаа→калай tin emendation.",
    "manas-2010:p1528:b001:l037": "Teeth worn raw while biting/tightening armor retained as labor image, not literal flaying by another person.",
    "manas-2010:p1528:b001:l040": "көзү коюл eyes heavy with exhaustion/sleep, exact Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/коюл/ II; no invented blindness.",
    "manas-2010:p1529:b001:l012": "таш сайынган rank buttons on official caps; таза finest selected men, not bald heads. Established contextual lexicon finding.",
    "manas-2010:p1529:b001:l016": "Мөндү is Kalmyk come per source glossary1841:4–6; Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/мөндү/ confirms epic battle cry. English Come on, also all three repetitions1536:9. No non-name untranslated cry counted as English.",
    "manas-2010:p1529:b001:l033": "сурак ал govern/rule, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/сурак/; Solomon/Alexander legends not historical verification.",
    "manas-2010:p1529:b001:l041": "Printed бейлебестен provisionally without taking care/assessing, immediate admonition against needless death; raw unchanged.",
    "manas-2010:p1530:b001:l011": "айдар forelock/hair tuft and чок белбоо tasseled belt, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/айдар/ and https://el-sozduk.kg/чок/. Repeated1542:32; not helmet crest.",
    "manas-2010:p1530:b001:l014": "күн жайла weather-working magic, ensuing summer made winter and water frozen literal epic marvel; no rationalizing weather event.1530:16 clear night retained despite subsequent moon obscurity.",
    "manas-2010:p1530:b001:l031": "Gendered taunt whimpering girls retained as narrator’s simile, not changed to gender-neutral weakness.",
    "manas-2010:p1531:b001:l009": "зубун troop/group/clan per exact edition glossary1838:5; troop chosen military context, all repeats retained. Also1544:20.",
    "manas-2010:p1531:b001:l021": "топон суу Deluge/flood, Great Beijing described untouched by it; not a modern historical flood claim.",
    "manas-2010:p1531:b001:l040": "Two fired bricks per man explicitly retained across1531:40–41, tied to ensuing encirclement and defenses; no inferred modern weapon or added brick count.",
    "manas-2010:p1532:b001:l006": "шор кайнат cause misery, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/шор/; boiling misfortunes image retained here, boiling misery1543:1. Exact1546:13 формула rendered inescapable misery, not boiled brine poured on captives.",
    "manas-2010:p1532:b001:l012": "Printed names in harmony retained though Serek/Syrgak only approximate phonetic pair; same formula Almambet/Chubak1539:12, no names altered to force rhyme.",
    "manas-2010:p1532:b001:l017": "Printed Ордун салын is not confidently resolved in escape/positioning context. A separately published Kyrgyz quotation in Ubukeev has Ордун салып, but this only supports a variant ending, not whole-phrase meaning. Do not silently normalize or invent a maneuver. Completion-first first pass: Best-effort rendering from a close formulaic parallel; retain for specialist review because the source was previously unresolved.",
    "manas-2010:p1532:b001:l034": "сан epic multitude unit vast host, no fixed census. Also1534:10,1537:5; seven сан1542:35 becomes seven vast hosts, explicit seven retained.",
    "manas-2010:p1532:b001:l039": "Cow-rumped literal horse conformation epithet retained for Sarala; not changed to a cow mount.",
    "manas-2010:p1533:b001:l024": "кызыталак coarse curse literally daughter divorced, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/талак/; literal curse retained without invented sexual act.",
    "manas-2010:p1533:b001:l025": "Printed question about Chinese crime against the Lord retained despite surrounding hostile characterization; no negation or divine favoritism supplied.",
    "manas-2010:p1534:b001:l002": "Printed Ойгут preserved as Oygut, not silently Noygut.",
    "manas-2010:p1534:b001:l008": "ырапыс ribbed cloth/reps, source glossary1844:6 and exact Yudakhin formula https://el-sozduk.kg/ырапыс/. Repeated1543:26; not opaque transliteration or invented silk.",
    "manas-2010:p1534:b001:l016": "калдай historical governors, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/калдай/; all repeats translated. Six thousand Chinese and thousand governors kept, repeated1544:16.",
    "manas-2010:p1534:b001:l019": "Brow/eyebrow disregard provisionally fearlessness under blows; body-part image retained, not an injury asserted here.",
    "manas-2010:p1534:b001:l026": "шири rawhide restraint over head/eyes, not opaque term. Captive women, plunder and lethal threats remain proposed speech1534:35–1535:2.",
    "manas-2010:p1535:b001:l005": "Printed girth and head retained as two things to put right. Could allude to girth-like braided hairstyle or equipment, but no explicit braid inserted.",
    "manas-2010:p1535:b001:l014": "буй кыл throw into confusion/distress, exact Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/буй/; replaces overgeneral subdue.",
    "manas-2010:p1536:b001:l006": "кара бас childbed demon/evil spirit formula retained as simile for frantic behavior, not actual report of wife’s illness.",
    "manas-2010:p1536:b001:l019": "Saddle pommel and heart’s head, then ammunition belt/lungs/heart are repeated aiming images; not deleted as redundant. Attackers change at1536:24 Kongurbay.",
    "manas-2010:p1537:b001:l006": "кыргак trusted support/comrade, Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/кыргак/ III. Printed кара калпак rendered black-capped people; possible Karakalpak ethnic association remains open, not silently black steel. Repeated1545:15.",
    "manas-2010:p1538:b001:l005": "көк provisionally fierce/stubborn men in reinforcement list, not the sky or an invented person named Kök.",
    "manas-2010:p1538:b001:l020": "чалма lasso cast by sorcerers here; literal implement retained, no invented spell text or purely metaphorical snare.",
    "manas-2010:p1538:b001:l025": "Compressed subject shifts between defenders’ confusion and Chinese entry1538:25–28 left provisionally without inserted personal names.",
    "manas-2010:p1538:b001:l029": "топ cannon in shot/haze context, distinct from troop/group elsewhere.1538:30 бузулбаган provisionally unfailing shots, compared1542:41 бузулбай тийген; not a claim of modern ammunition reliability.",
    "manas-2010:p1538:b001:l034": "Not one of former men retained as source change of opposing force; no harmonization with repeatedly returning leaders.",
    "manas-2010:p1538:b001:l042": "No man matters in his eyes, qualified fearless/disregarding-opponents idiom rather than blindness; next two Jangjung leaders continue assault.",
    "manas-2010:p1539:b001:l010": "Алабаш Alabash printed horse name retained although Syrgak is on Kökchebich1539:34 and companions usually Sarala/Kögala. No silent horse substitution.",
    "manas-2010:p1540:b001:l002": "ок жылан arrow-snake literal translated creature designation, no unsupported zoological species identification.",
    "manas-2010:p1540:b001:l026": "Printed six retained despite surrounding three named heroes plus forty companions and subsequent explicit forty-three1541:3.",
    "manas-2010:p1541:b001:l004": "Chinese rejoicing in valor retained literally; admiration versus narrator subject shift uncertain, not silently replaced with fear.",
    "manas-2010:p1541:b001:l011": "Four narrator lines about truth/falsehood and no returning witness1541:11–14 retained as verse, not discarded as editorial prose.",
    "manas-2010:p1541:b001:l015": "чыңыроон signaling horn, Yudakhin/2015 https://el-sozduk.kg/чыңыроо/; qualified sound interpretation in empty-land formula. Not invented bird species.",
    "manas-2010:p1541:b001:l024": "беркел acclaim well done, not a personal name or English-untranslated interjection.",
    "manas-2010:p1541:b001:l032": "жая horse-rump meat cut for feasting; translated as rump meat, no added recipe.",
    "manas-2010:p1541:b001:l041": "Азирет holy/venerable one, probably Ali by repeated epic formula; printed unspecified honorific retained without inserting Ali’s name.",
    "manas-2010:p1542:b001:l012": "жалаңкыч death-taking angel,1969 https://el-sozduk.kg/жалаңкыч/; not an unexplained name.",
    "manas-2010:p1542:b001:l028": "Printed ур swelling retained; supported by Yudakhin reverse шишка https://el-sozduk.kg/шишка/. Possible missing н of нур light not silently emended. Exact facial image remains qualified.",
    "manas-2010:p1543:b001:l015": "Parenthetical1543:15–17 is three verse display lines in same typography, narrator genealogy Manas and Syrgak sons of brothers retained with parentheses; not editorial heading. Age twenty-one1543:23 also retained.",
    "manas-2010:p1544:b001:l017": "ашкере outstanding/particularly marked, qualified nominal reading from1969/2015 sense2 https://el-sozduk.kg/ашкере/. Not silently ашкереси→аскери army or replacement by elder in earlier1534:17 formula.",
    "manas-2010:p1545:b001:l003": "муштап struck, no weapon or fist specified beyond verb because later1545:19 says speared; no inconsistent weapon repair.",
    "manas-2010:p1545:b001:l005": "Forty lords appear again after earlier slaughter account; printed forty retained, no resurrection explanation invented.",
    "manas-2010:p1545:b001:l022": "керик rhinoceros, exact source glossary1839:12. Gray rhinoceros retained despite next ат generic horse/mount wording; no unverified horse name substituted.",
    "manas-2010:p1545:b001:l029": "Before clauses1545:29–31 signify interrupted attempt to kill Jangjung, prevented by Kongurbay’s rescue; not a completed beheading followed by revival.",
    "manas-2010:p1545:b001:l035": "Not even wind touching retained as protected rescue image, not literal weather manipulation by Kongurbay.",
    "manas-2010:p1546:b001:l029": "Seven күнчө approximately seven days of Syrgak’s rearguard stand, not exact timestamp or cut to one day.",
    "manas-2010:p1546:b001:l037": "даңкан clods/stones thrown by hooves, exact source glossary1836:31–33; not helmet or kettledrum. Cauldron-sized exaggeration retained.",
    "manas-2010:p1546:b001:l042": "чаткаяк space between hind legs from groin toward knees,2015 https://el-sozduk.kg/chatkayak-4/; tail lashes there, not flanks."
